result:
The rank foundation and the first atomic base cases are now verified in `/workspace/dev7.v`:

- lexicographic `rankA`/`rankB` with all required cross-call decreases proved;
- `cmp_asub` extracted from `sle_asub_strong`;
- unconditional `cmp_trans_top`, `B_top`, `cmp_trans_int`, `B_int`, `cmp_trans_unit`, `B_unit`, using induction on the `cmp` derivation rather than a same-middle `B` call.

A focused continuation is running on the remaining `B` base cases (`bot`, `prim`, `arrow`) and then the `B` splitting cases and `A`. The key technique now fixed in the approach is:

- target splits (`i = i1 ∨ i2`) are handled by induction on the given `cmp` derivation with a smaller target, not by a same-middle `B` recursion, so the rank obstruction does not reappear;
- arrow comparisons use `B(c1,·,·)`/`B(c2,·,·)` at strictly smaller domain/codomain components;
- `A`’s arrow-source splits use `asub_splu_proj`/`asub_target_I` to obtain component `asub` facts and then `B` at a strictly smaller middle plus `A` on strictly smaller sources.

The completeness theorem in `Task.v` is still open; no proof escape has been used.

The arrow/arrow sub-branch is now proved in `/workspace/dev24.v`:

- `sle_b1_a1_of_H1` (domain aggregation),
- `arrow_compare_of_H1` (the full `C_arrow` assembly from the two `C_arrow` premises and the `I (arr X Y)` component facts).

The continuation is integrating this into `B_arrow_split`:

- `U (arr X Y) = [arr X Y]`, so H2 gives `cmp (arr X Y) i`;
- inversion splits into `C_top`, `C_or_l/r` (inner target induction), and `C_arrow`;
- in the `C_arrow` case, source `u` splits into `t_bot` (`C_bot`), `t_arrow a1 a2` (`arrow_compare_of_H1`), and `t_and u1 u2` (`B_arrow_and_Y`);
- other ordu source forms contradict the nonempty `I` family.

The remaining open mathematical case is `B_arrow_and_Y` (the non-uniform meet source), followed by the other `B` splitting cases, `asub_to_cmp_oi`, and the rank wiring. The endgame (`surj.v`, `dev23/24`, `closure.v`, `endgame.v`, `primtrans.v`) is otherwise ready. `Task.v` is still incomplete; no proof escape has been used.

